      },
      "text": "Fiber roving (loose bundle)\n       |\n       ↓ DRAFTING (attenuation)\n  Thinner, longer bundle of aligned fibers\n       |\n       ↓ TWISTING\n  Fibers locked together by inter-fiber friction\n       |\n       ↓\n  YARN — a continuous strand with tensile strength"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-YARN-SPINNING.md#005",
      "path": [
