      "text": "CONSEQUENCES:\n    S-plied Z-spun yarn → dimensionally stable, flat\n    Z-plied Z-spun yarn → over-twisted, kinky, bias in fabric\n    Mixing twist directions in warp/weft → diagonal tension in fabric\n    Some design effects use this deliberately (crepe fabrics)\n```"
