      "text": "```\n  ANATOMY:\n    ┌───────────────────────────────┐\n    │  Distaff (holds unspun fiber) │\n    │        |                      │\n    │  Spindle shaft (stick)        │\n    │        |                      │\n    │  Whorl (weight disk) at       │\n    │  top, middle, or bottom       │\n    └───────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-YARN-SPINNING.md#017",
      "path": [
        "04-YARN-SPINNING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:textiles:04-yarn-spinning, git-history:textiles:04-yarn-spinning]",
