        "root_concepts": "[yarn, spinning]",
        "section": "textiles",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Yarn and Spinning",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "OPERATION:\n    1. Attach leader thread to shaft\n    2. Draft fiber from distaff or hand\n    3. Set spindle spinning (fingers or thigh)\n    4. Spindle falls under gravity while spinning\n    5. Twist travels up drafted fiber as spindle drops\n    6. Wind spun yarn onto spindle shaft\n    7. Repeat"
    },
