      "text": "```\n  GREAT WHEEL (Walking Wheel, ~1000 CE):\n    Large driving wheel turned by hand\n    Drive band rotates horizontal spindle\n    Spinner drafts fiber and walks backward while spinning\n    Then walks forward while winding\n    Speed: ~3× drop spindle\n    Still: intermittent process (draft then wind)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-YARN-SPINNING.md#022",
      "path": [
        "04-YARN-SPINNING.md"
