      "text": "FLYER-BOBBIN MECHANISM:\n    ┌────────────────────────────────────┐\n    │  U-shaped flyer                    │\n    │    rotates at slightly different   │\n    │    speed from bobbin               │\n    │                                    │\n    │  Yarn path: through orifice →      │\n    │  around flyer arm → onto bobbin    │\n    │                                    │\n    │  Twist added in orifice-to-flyer   │\n    │  section; wind-on at speed         │\n    │  differential between flyer/bobbin │\n    └────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
