      "text": "SPINNING JENNY (Hargreaves, ~1764):\n  Multiple spindles (8 → 80 → 120) operated by one person\n  Hand-operated (no water power — cottage industry)\n  Spinning only, no automatic drafting\n  Enabled massive increase in spindle count per worker\n  Hargreaves' cottage attacked by textile workers fearing job loss"
    },
